# =========================
# Data files ONLY (not code)
# =========================
!/outputs/*hh*.csv
!/schwabAPI/*
!/schwabAPI/*.csv
!/schwabAPI/corporate_actions.json
*.csv
# ranked signal snapshots — intentionally tracked
!/Data/*.csv
# CONFIG CSVs ARE SOURCE, not pipeline output: the repo owns them and they are
# meant to be diffed, reviewed and restored from git. These negations MUST sit
# after the *.csv catch-all above, or it wins and they vanish silently — which
# is exactly what happened to reminders.csv (documented as "versioned, visible
# in a diff" while untracked and living only on one SD card) and nearly
# happened to chitra_holdings.csv.
!/reminders.csv
!/chitra_holdings.csv
*.parquet
*.json

# BUT keep python source code
!**/*.py
!**/__init__.py

